    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d108-a3">

                <pb facs="0382" n="1012" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v2/pg1012"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure D.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">General Sickles to Rear-Admiral Case.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-07-22"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 22,
                        1873</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit herewith, for
                    your information, a copy and translation of a decree of the government of Spain,
                    dated 20th instant, and published yesterday in the Official Gazette.</p>
                <p>The same documents have been sent to Captain Wells, of the Shenandoah, with a
                    letter, of which a copy is inclosed.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>D. E. SICKLES.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
